We've arrived at Act 2 of our show, in which our subject is actually Act 1 of our show.

00:42:36.940 --> 00:42:40.040
And so, Act 2 of our show, Act 1.

00:42:41.600 --> 00:42:45.980
When I saw Mike Daisy perform this story on stage, when I left the theater, I had a lot of questions.

00:42:46.550 --> 00:42:50.020
He's not a reporter, and I wondered, did he get it right?

00:42:50.020 --> 00:42:50.180
Right.

00:42:51.080 --> 00:42:54.580
And so we've actually spent a few weeks checking everything that he says in his show.

