Even people who are critical of Foxconn for all kinds of things agreed with this.

00:46:47.460 --> 00:46:52.400
They said maybe a stray worker here and there might get in on a borrowed ID, but it is not a widespread problem.

00:46:53.040 --> 00:46:54.800
Well, I don't know if it's a big problem.

00:46:55.000 --> 00:46:56.200
I just know that I saw it.

00:46:56.460 --> 00:46:57.340
Again, Mike Daisy.

00:46:57.820 --> 00:46:59.500
He says, sure, maybe it's not prevalent.

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:04.060
I know that I met people that were there and I know that I that I talked to them.

00:47:04.540 --> 00:47:08.980
I mean, there weren't very many as a proportion of the total group.

00:47:09.100 --> 00:47:10.740
I talked to more than 100 people.

